+{id:'s3',ch:'sil',type:'w',
+ q:'Firmware switches SMCLK to VLO to save power but leaves its UART divisor computed as 1000000/9600. Work through the numbers: what divisor does it program, what actual baud results, and why did the pre-fix simulator certify this firmware?',
