+{id:'s6',ch:'sil',type:'w',
+ q:'A regression test asserts CLOCK:SMCLK:FREQUENCY? == "1000000" and started failing with "4800000" after an unrelated test file gained a CLOCK:SMCLK:SOURCE MODCLK line. Diagnose the failure and give two robust fixes.',
+ c:[{l:'clock configuration persists on a shared device — state leaked from the other test',t:['persist','leak','shared','state','other test','previous test']},
+    {l:'"1000000" silently assumes the DCO/1 default; MODCLK makes SMCLK 4.8 MHz',t:['assume','default','4.8','dco/1','4800000']},
