+{id:'s1',ch:'sil',type:'w',
+ q:'Before 5e2ba08, WDT:PASSWORD was a no-op that accepted anything. Explain why that made a whole class of firmware bugs invisible to SIL testing — give a concrete firmware defect the old model would have blessed.',
