+  <div class="chk" id="c5" onclick="tick('c5')"><span class="box">☐</span> 5. Aliasing: PERIOD IS CCR0</div>
+  <div class="chk" id="c6" onclick="tick('c6')"><span class="box">☐</span> 6. Stored-state modeling</div>
+  <div class="chk" id="c7" onclick="tick('c7')"><span class="box">☐</span> 7. Why SIL cares</div>
