+    <summary>Show answer</summary>
+    <div class="ans">
+      <p>The divider write succeeds (1 is in the valid set), but <code>PERIOD 100000</code> hits the CCR0 width guard: 100000 &gt; 0xFFFF (65535), so the model queues <strong>-222 "CCR value out of range (0-0xFFFF)"</strong> and CCR0 is unchanged. Before a20fbb1 it would have stored 100000 and the test would have validated an impossible timer.</p>
