+    </ul>
+    <div class="feedback"></div>
+  </div>
+
+  <!-- Q4 -->
+  <div class="question" data-question>
+    <p class="q-text"><span class="q-num">Q4.</span> Before commit 701853d, what did <code>CLOCK:MCLK:FREQUENCY?</code> return after <code>CLOCK:MCLK:SOURCE LFXT</code> (all else default), and what does it return now?</p>
